# MagicCode Streaming (prebuilt)

This directory ships a **closed-source** static library and public C headers
so the video-call app can call MagicCode Streaming.

- `include/mc_streaming.h`, `include/mcs_err.h` — public API
- `lib/android/arm64-v8a/libmc_streaming.a`
- `lib/ios/libmc_streaming.a`

